<item><title>Mauritania intercepts 94 young Guineans bound for the Canary Islands</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/mauritania-intercepts-94-young-guineans-bound-for-the-664500/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/mauritania-intercepts-94-young-guineans-bound-for-the-664500/</guid><category>Guinea</category><description>Mauritanian coast guards stopped the boat off Nouadhibou on 19 November, and the group is now being housed in Rosso while it waits for travel documents.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 20:01:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" length="31286" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
